      "description": "<p>During a conflict, you may use an action and spend 10 Mind Points to <strong>choose one option:</strong></p><ul><li>All MP costs are doubled</li><li>All sources of damage deal <strong>【SL × 3】</strong> extra damage</li></ul><p>The chosen effect lasts until the start of your next turn.</p>",
