      "heroic_requirement": "",
      "implementation_note": "Choose one option when you use it; it applies to EVERY creature in the conflict (you, allies and enemies) until the start of your next turn. Costs: each creature's actions with a printed MP cost cost double (the extra is added to the action card). Not doubled: MP a skill spends inside its own effect chain (e.g. Gadgets, Stolen Time, High Speed). A creature that cannot afford the doubled cost is not stopped automatically: it spends all its remaining MP and the action still resolves, so the GM should rule that action out at the table. Damage: every hit any creature takes gets +SL×3 before Affinities; typeless/true damage is not increased.",
